Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:56:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(money): classifier can refuse private on an unwalked
 corporate owner (requireOwnerChain, opt-in)

Ownership-chain traversal: a private-law form on an owner is not evidence the chain ends private. Replay of the 2026-08-23 sweep: 16 of 33 private verdicts (2.5 bn CZK) rest on an unwalked corporate owner, incl. two Ceske drahy subsidiaries. Inert until the sweep passes the option.

Doc-sync: opt-in classifier option, no caller passes it yet, so no user- or contributor-visible behavior shift.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
